  },
  "body": "The existing wording gives the impression that the fixed point only deals with capability permissions. However, if Zyhybrid is available and ypermc is used to clear the X permission on a capablity with M=1, then ypermc also legalizes the result by setting M=0.\r\n\r\nClarify the wording that ypermc may not only adjust the resulting permissions, but also capability metadata, like the M-bit of Zyhybrid.\r\n\r\nFixes #941.",
